01:02:19,172 --> 01:02:24,462
いつまでも忘れないと あなたが言ってくれた夏
The summer you told me you would never forget,

416
01:02:31,162 --> 01:02:35,412
時間が流れ 今頃あたしは
As time flows by, right about now...

417
01:02:37,462 --> 01:02:42,072
涙がこぼれてきた
Tears have started to spill.

418
01:02:48,432 --> 01:02:54,182
あなたと過ごした日々を この胸に焼き付けよう
Let's burn the days spent with you into this heart.

419
01:02:55,322 --> 01:03:00,282
思い出さなくても 大丈夫なように
So that even if I don't remember, I'll be okay.

420
01:03:01,142 --> 01:03:06,412
いつか他の誰かを 好きになったとしても
Even if I someday come to love someone else,

421
01:03:09,212 --> 01:03:12,282
あなたは ずっと
You will always...

422
01:03:12,432 --> 01:03:15,962
特別で 大切で
be special and precious,

423
01:03:17,752 --> 01:03:23,212
またこの季節が 廻ってく
And this season will come around again.

424
01:03:50,936 --> 01:04:01,496
Thank you so much guys for coming to my very first 3D birthday live!

425
01:04:01,496 --> 01:04:10,916
I've always wanted to do this, so I'm super happy that I was able to finally do this. And thank you so much for all your support and all the wonderful staff that were involved in making this live possible and making this amazing.

426
01:04:11,236 --> 01:04:17,476
えっと、たくさんみんな初めての3Dライブに来て下さりありがとうございます。
Um, thank you so much everyone for coming to my very first 3D live.

427
01:04:17,476 --> 01:04:27,336
みんなの応援のおかげ、それと素敵なスタッフさんのあの努力のおかげでとてもいいライブになったかなと思います。本当にありがとうございました。
Thanks to everyone's support and the wonderful staff's hard work, I think it turned out to be a really great live. Thank you truly so much.

428
01:04:28,556 --> 01:04:34,656
そして、チャンネル登録100万人も本当にありがとうございます！みんなのおかげです。
And thank you so much for reaching 1 million subscribers as well! It's all thanks to everyone.

429
01:04:34,656 --> 01:04:40,476
And thank you so much for helping me reach one million subscribers today. I really appreciate it.

430
01:04:40,576 --> 01:04:46,056
Thank you very much for coming. Bye-ris! Bye-byee!

431
01:05:00,104 --> 01:05:04,256
